abstract: >-
  Formal models (ProVerif, CryptoVerif, EasyCrypt), the source code of the NIPoK-SE prototype and of six baseline
  PSU-authentication mechanisms, a three-cluster Kubernetes testbed, JMH and k6 benchmark harnesses, analysis scripts
  and derived results of the revised manuscript. The raw measurement data are archived on Zenodo as a separate dataset,
  https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.24370110.
